CalldataSliceLib::sliceUint8
├── given zero value
│   ├── it should return 0
│   └── it should return offset + 1
├── given max value (255)
│   ├── it should return 255
│   └── it should return offset + 1
├── given value in middle of data
│   ├── it should read from correct offset
│   └── it should return offset + 1
└── given sequential reads
    └── it should read each byte correctly with advancing offset